<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Confirmă contul</title>
  <style>
    /* Reset și stiluri de bază */
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f5f7fa;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #2d3748;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* Header - Stil NestJS */
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0234e 0%, #c01e44 100%);
      padding: 40px 40px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .header::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f5a623, #e0234e, #f5a623);
      background-size: 200% 100%;
      animation: shimmer 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes shimmer {
      0%, 100% {
        background-position: 200% 0;
      }
      50% {
        background-position: -200% 0;
      }
    }

    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .header .subtitle {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    /* Logo icon */
    .logo-icon {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      border-radius: 50%;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .logo-icon svg {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      fill: #ffffff;
    }

    /* Content */
    .content {
      padding: 48px 40px 40px;
    }

    .greeting {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a202c;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .message {
      color: #4a5568;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .message strong {
      color: #e0234e;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* Token / Cod de verificare */
    .token-container {
      background: #f7fafc;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 32px 0;
      border: 2px dashed #e2e8f0;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .token-container:hover {
      border-color: #e0234e;
      background: #fff5f7;
    }

    .token-label {
      font-size: 14px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: #a0aec0;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .token-code {
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1a202c;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      background: #edf2f7;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: inline-block;
      user-select: all;
    }

    .token-expiry {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #718096;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .token-expiry span {
      color: #e0234e;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer {
      background: #f7fafc;
      padding: 24px 40px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .footer p {
      color: #718096;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .footer .help-text {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #a0aec0;
    }

    .footer .help-text a {
      color: #e0234e;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .footer .help-text a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .container {
        margin: 20px auto;
        border-radius: 12px;
      }

      .header {
        padding: 30px 20px 24px;
      }

      .header h1 {
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 32px 24px;
      }

      .token-code {
        font-size: 24px;
        padding: 10px 16px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 20px 24px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="logo-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h1>Confirmă contul</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Bun venit în comunitatea noastră</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="content">
    <p class="greeting">Salut!</p>
    <p class="message">
      <strong>Îți mulțumim că ți-ai creat un cont!</strong><br>
      Pentru a-ți activa contul și a beneficia de toate funcționalitățile,
      te rugăm să verifici adresa de email folosind codul de mai jos.
    </p>

    <!-- Token Code -->
    <div class="token-container">
      <div class="token-label">🔑 Cod de verificare</div>
      <div class="token-code">{{token}}</div>
      <div class="token-expiry">
        ⏱️ Acest cod expiră în <span>{{expiresInMinutes}} minute</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div class="footer">
    <p>Ai primit acest email pentru că ți-ai creat un cont pe platforma noastră.</p>
    <p class="help-text">
      Dacă nu ai solicitat acest email, poți să îl ignori.<br>
      Pentru asistență, contactează-ne la <a href="mailto:support@example.com">support@example.com</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>